{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"9ef136d4338231c7","type":"text","text":"[[Daunting Zeppelin]]\n- A mysterious Zeppelin rose up from the Reflective Cloud 13 minutes into the loop.\n- The entrance to the Zeppelin is closed shut. The door seems to be connected to some sort of turbine.\n- **I entered the Zeppelin when the winds were strong enough to turn the turbine.**\n- **In the cockpit of the Daunting Zeppelin, I found a frequency that represents the speed the Zeppelin used to successfully pass the Reflective Cloud.**","x":1140,"y":583,"width":470,"height":300,"color":"#0400ff"},
		{"id":"8857f29ad244d4a5","type":"text","text":"In the cockpit of the Daunting Zeppelin, I found a frequency that represents the speed the Zeppelin used to successfully pass the Reflective Cloud.","x":890,"y":920,"width":450,"height":97,"color":"#0400ff"},
		{"id":"9c964e9bbf0e4cdc","type":"text","text":"[[Blowing Behemoth Anomaly Lab]]\n- **I found a mysterious lab on Blowing Behemoth. It has some odd devices with sand inside them, as well as a Media Player and a White Hole.**\n- **A display device inside Blowing Behemoth's Anomaly Lab suggests something important lies in the core of Blowing Behemoth.**\n - **A display device in the Blowing Behemoth Anomaly Lab hints at a structure inside Divine Devourer.**","x":475,"y":1520,"width":485,"height":280,"color":"#0400ff"},
		{"id":"64178852e67b62bc","type":"text","text":"[[Frigid Fog Anomaly Lab]]\n\n- **I found a mysterious lab on Frigid Fog. It has some odd devices with sand inside them, as well as a Media Player and a White Hole.**\n- **A display device inside Frigid Fog's Anomaly Lab shows a structure on the North Pole.**          \n- **A display device in the Frigid Fog Anomaly Lab hints at a structure inside Divine Devourer.** ","x":-492,"y":940,"width":400,"height":279,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"26a600a3673ea092","type":"text","text":"A display device in the Blowing Behemoth Anomaly Lab hints at a structure inside Divine Devourer.","x":202,"y":1820,"width":395,"height":120,"color":"#000000"},
		{"id":"b9788e8b797c317b","type":"text","text":"A display device in the Frigid Fog Anomaly Lab hints at a structure inside Divine Devourer.","x":-489,"y":1292,"width":395,"height":108,"color":"#000000"},
		{"id":"3a2ba607bd67937a","type":"text","text":"[[Maroon Meadows Anomaly Lab]]\n- **I found a mysterious lab on Maroon Meadows. It has some odd devices with sand inside them, as well as a Media Player and a White Hole.**\n- **A display device inside Maroon Meadows's Anomaly Lab shows a structure on the North Pole.**          \n- **A display device in the Maroon Meadows Anomaly Lab hints at a structure inside Divine Devourer.** ","x":-1000,"y":1100,"width":432,"height":300,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"f058da0face124c8","type":"text","text":"A display device in the Maroon Meadows Anomaly Lab hints at a structure inside Divine Devourer.","x":-981,"y":1426,"width":395,"height":108,"color":"#000000"},
		{"id":"b653684ccca8f48e","type":"text","text":"[[Tuning Studio]] (Frigid Fog North Pole)\n\n- I can't get inside the Hurricane on the North Pole.\n- I found several patches of exposed dirt near the North Pole.\n- I dug through an excavation point and found a tunnel.\n- Some of the tunnels don't seem to lead anywhere worthwhile. \n- One of the tunnels goes beneath the North Pole and leads to the eye of the Hurricane. \n- **I found the building inside the North Pole, seemingly resembling some sort of studio used for audio frequency tuning.**\n- **A display device in the Frigid Fog Tuning Studio showed the core of Blowing Behemoth, and is associated with the sequence of sound used to enable it.**\n  \n  TODO: Add Recording and turn into Warped Planetarium","x":-83,"y":400,"width":600,"height":360,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"1a03927da8506466","type":"text","text":"A display device inside Frigid Fog's Anomaly Lab shows a structure on the North Pole.","x":-440,"y":795,"width":420,"height":80,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2b28fdf8a75a4fdd","type":"text","text":"[[Conductive Energy Plant]]\n- **I found the entrance to the structure of Blowing Behemoth's core.**\n- **A display device in the Conductive Energy Plant shows that the event horizon is safe to cross if you approach it at the same speed as entering the lower atmosphere in Blowing Behemoth.**","x":517,"y":1060,"width":493,"height":238,"color":"#0400ff"},
		{"id":"7aad23b32157e6e3","type":"text","text":"A display device inside Blowing Behemoth's Anomaly Lab suggests something important lies in the core of Blowing Behemoth.","x":536,"y":1385,"width":364,"height":100,"color":"#0400ff"},
		{"id":"a214632c3deadd73","type":"text","text":"A display device in the Frigid Fog Tuning Studio showed the core of Blowing Behemoth, and is associated with the sequence of sound used to enable it.","x":202,"y":889,"width":516,"height":102,"color":"#0400ff"},
		{"id":"16aefc45bfb24bcb","type":"text","text":"A display device in the Conductive Energy Plant shows that the event horizon is safe to cross if you approach it at the same speed as entering the lower atmosphere in Blowing Behemoth.","x":217,"y":1064,"width":240,"height":230,"color":"#0400ff"},
		{"id":"4d125d55f2fe2b68","type":"text","text":"A display device in the Warped Planetarium shows that the event horizon is safe to cross at roughly the same angle as the eccentricity of the planets' orbits.","x":-48,"y":1191,"width":250,"height":209,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"7f8a495bd0be86c5","type":"text","text":"In the cockpit of the Daunting Zeppelin, I found a frequency that represents the speed the Zeppelin used to successfully pass the Reflective Cloud.","x":1414,"y":969,"width":448,"height":108,"color":"#0400ff"},
		{"id":"9c011689e4937ff8","type":"text","text":"[[Reflective Cloud]]\n- A thick layer of clouds repels me, preventing me from descending deeper into Blowing Behemoth.\n- I was able to pass the Reflective Cloud by going roughly 1 m/s.","x":1080,"y":1140,"width":370,"height":215,"color":"#0400ff"},
		{"id":"b761a4377552481c","type":"text","text":"[[Weather Station]]\n- **I found a shelter with tons of weather-related devices inside and out, or so it seems that way.**\n- **A display device in the Weather Station shows that at some point within the loop, the turbines will spin, opening whatever door they are connected to.**","x":1115,"y":148,"width":404,"height":256,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"4f03cec918bf8511","type":"text","text":"Player notices wind turbines connect to the Zeppelin entrance.","x":1127,"y":456,"width":497,"height":62,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"cbc2ddd0822666da","type":"text","text":"[[Cartography Studio]]\n- I found a mapmaking studio on Maroon Meadows.\n- Nothing inside the Cartography Studio is capable of surviving the flood.\n- I heard an otherworldly message on the recorder in the Cartography Studio. It appeared to sound like \"Sa\"\n- The display device with the Frigid Fog Icon marks a location on the Southwest Hemisphere of the planet.\n- The display device with the Blowing Behemoth Icon marks a location on the South Pole of the planet's high cloud layer.\n- The other display device with the Blowing Behemoth Icon marks a location on the North Pole of the planet's high cloud layer.\n- The display device with the Purple Partition Icon marks a location on the Northern Hemisphere of the planet's Far Side.\n- The display device with the Purple Partition Icon marks a location near the Equator of the planet's Far Side.","x":-1675,"y":983,"width":580,"height":425,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"4cf75d9b9050d908","type":"text","text":"The display device with the Blowing Behemoth Icon marks a location on the South Pole of the planet's high cloud layer.","x":-1889,"y":1480,"width":429,"height":100,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"a73fa4ce4dbdc691","type":"text","text":"The other display device with the Blowing Behemoth Icon marks a location on the North Pole of the planet's high cloud layer.","x":-1385,"y":1480,"width":359,"height":100,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"bea74a6db51e9fcc","type":"text","text":"[[Frozen Disc Cloud]]\n- I found a Frozen Cloud with a Media Disc frozen inside.\n- The Media Disc fell down when the Frozen Cloud thawed, never to be seen again.\n- **I was able to grab the Media Disc while it thawed before it had the chance to fall.**\n- **I heard an eerie language on the media disc. It sounded like \"_\"**","x":-1889,"y":1633,"width":429,"height":290,"color":"#0400ff"},
		{"id":"a0b6f8d08408b60c","type":"text","text":"I heard an eerie language on the media disc. It sounded like \"Zauthfin S'Zhka porrra ih shas tsaye nyarrr.\"","x":-1871,"y":1960,"width":392,"height":100,"color":"#0400ff"},
		{"id":"d6c9669ff09a49d1","type":"text","text":"[[Abandoned Camp]]\n- I found an abandoned camp with an audio recorder.\n- I can't hear the audio recorder at the camp. The blizzard winds are too loud.\n- **I heard an eerie language on the media disc. It sounded like \"_\"**","x":-2280,"y":1633,"width":375,"height":227,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"9847a09e17d7a46c","type":"text","text":"I heard an eerie language on the media disc. It sounded like \"Yan S'Chayeethoofahn, zauth eh, ah, uthu, ah, eh, ih tsu.\"","x":-2280,"y":1923,"width":375,"height":97,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"4dfcb8d9e86fb764","type":"text","text":"A recording in the Botany Lab has a sequence of sounds that seem to point out a path past the Hurricane. I also heard digging in the recording.","x":-664,"y":530,"width":449,"height":100,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"e9363a723413cc2c","type":"text","text":"[[Botany Lab]]\n- I found an overgrown structure on Maroon Meadows.\n- I used my scout to give the plants inside some light, emitting a wavelength that opens the door.\n- A display device in the Botany Lab shows that a pump structure can siphon out all of the planet's water and allow the door to function.\n- A recording in the Botany Lab has a sequence of sounds that seem to point out a path past the Hurricane. I also heard digging in the recording.","x":-655,"y":160,"width":432,"height":320,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"db246492cbd147bb","type":"text","text":"A display device inside Maroon Meadows's Anomaly Lab shows a structure near the core of the Maroon Meadows.","x":-987,"y":935,"width":406,"height":97,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"955585dc6f3ce753","type":"text","text":"A display device in the Botany Lab shows that a pump structure can siphon out all of the planet's water and allow the door to function.","x":-1784,"y":320,"width":485,"height":100,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"66e94fe86ea6faf1","type":"text","text":"[[Echo Caverns]]\n- One of the caverns inside Purple Partition has very loud ambience due to the echo.\n- I can't hear the recorder in the Echo Caverns with all of this contained noise.\n- SOLUTION TO BE DETERMIEND\n- I heard an eerie language on the media disc. It sounded like \"_\"","x":-2720,"y":1614,"width":403,"height":265,"color":"#990099"},
		{"id":"7d4248833b681cb0","type":"text","text":"I heard an eerie language on the media disc. It sounded like \"Zauthfin s'thrrrash, Zoothau s'thrrrashooyau\". It also plays a song after the message.","x":-2720,"y":1923,"width":403,"height":126,"color":"#990099"},
		{"id":"09206304f23d875c","type":"text","text":"[[Plasma Blast Furnace]]\n- **After opening the way in the Refraction Caverns, the caves led me down to the structure at the core, completely submerged in lava powered by turbines.**\n- **Inside the structure was a massive blast furnace and a pump system.**\n- **The interface has a signal tuned to it. Tuning it off that point stops the pump from working.**\n- **A display device in the Plasma Blast Furnace shows that the liquid turbines work best when fully submerged.**\n- **I turned off the Plasma Blast Furnace and the power went out. It also feels a lot colder now.**\n","x":-2731,"y":795,"width":449,"height":377,"color":"#990099"},
		{"id":"838914b5ac9324de","type":"text","text":"The interface has a signal tuned to it. Tuning it off that point stops the pump from working.","x":-2240,"y":795,"width":340,"height":85,"color":"#990099"},
		{"id":"b2a63e8b153b89df","type":"text","text":"[[Abyssal Archives]]\n- I found a structure deep in the sea of Maroon Meadows and I can't open the door.\n- **I entered the door after using the Pumpworks to drain the ocean. Inside was a massive library containing several labelled media discs.**\n- **These discs seem to be the words of a new language!** ","x":-1051,"y":645,"width":535,"height":230,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"433c2d800c6e1758","type":"text","text":" I used the Pumpworks to drain the water.","x":-1026,"y":530,"width":345,"height":50,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"4b3a3d4f2fef649d","type":"text","text":"[[Pumpworks]]\n- I found a giant structure on Maroon Meadows that seems to look like some sort of extractor.\n- The entrance to the structure is sealed shut, but it is hooked to some kind of turbine.\n- After rising the lava and spinning a turbine, I got the Plasma Blast Furnace to start to function.\n- **The flood rose and turned the turbines, opening the door.**\n- **I can tune the device in the Pumpworks**\n- **I used the Pumpworks to drain the water by tuning it correctly.**","x":-1755,"y":485,"width":516,"height":320,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"87029f290126860c","type":"text","text":"A display device in the Plasma Blast Furnace shows that the liquid turbines work best when fully submerged.","x":-2230,"y":650,"width":320,"height":110,"color":"#990099"},
		{"id":"2a26ff7227ca2392","type":"text","text":"[[Excavation Outpost]]\n- **I found a mining outpost with an excavation device that's still running.**\n- **Eventually, the excavator strikes a pool of lava and floods the entire cavern.**\n- **A Display Device inside the Excavation Outpost shows the location of a jackhammer on Manic Mesa.**\n- **I found a luminous, yellow crystal deep within the bore hole.**\n- **I can pick the luminous crystal up right before the lava geyser erupts.**","x":-3130,"y":364,"width":580,"height":296,"color":"#870087"},
		{"id":"8ccefa5f9c9d8df1","type":"text","text":"A Display Device in the Enclosed Caverns displays a light crystal in the borehole.","x":-3071,"y":200,"width":462,"height":80,"color":"#870087"},
		{"id":"c1ac5692c6b53f95","type":"text","text":"[[Enclosed Caverns]]\n- I found a pathway blocked by a series of crystals.\n- I tried to use the jackhammer on the crystals themselves. It cannot break the crystals directly.\n- **Using the jackhammer on the hard floor made a screeching sound that was enough to break the crystals.**\n- A Display Device in the Enclosed Caverns displays a light crystal in the borehole.\n","x":-3110,"y":-120,"width":540,"height":252,"color":"#870087"},
		{"id":"3b39aaa5968032f1","type":"text","text":"The display device with the Frigid Fog Icon marks a location on the Southwest Hemisphere of the planet.","x":-2280,"y":1480,"width":375,"height":100,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"2ee0a1046d2a18a4","type":"text","text":"The display device with the Purple Partition Icon marks a location on the Northern Hemisphere of the planet's Far Side.","x":-2692,"y":1200,"width":375,"height":100,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"62a19378c4e16ec0","type":"text","text":"The display device with the Purple Partition Icon marks a location near the Equator of the planet's Far Side.","x":-2760,"y":1340,"width":375,"height":100,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"ec972c02c475193c","type":"text","text":"I can pick the luminous crystal up right before the lava geyser erupts.","x":-3280,"y":707,"width":363,"height":88,"color":"#990099"},
		{"id":"9ead5073d4a3a010","type":"text","text":"[[Frozen Cloud Campsite]]\n- **I found a lit campfire atop a frozen cloud. The fire is slowly melting the ground.**\n- **I found a recorder by the campsite.**\n- **I heard an eerie language on the media disc. It sounded like \"Yantsa S'Chayfrrrat Vashbinith, vin chin Chaylu ooo zhtheesau yantsin tsah ashaut.\"**","x":-1440,"y":1633,"width":470,"height":227,"color":"#0400ff"},
		{"id":"3680f90941d908f9","type":"text","text":"[[Refraction Caverns]]\n- I found a series of bright caverns deep within the mantle of Purple Partition.\n- When Purple Partition tears in half, the entire area collapses and fills with lava, rendering it inaccessible.\n- The lower caverns are decorated in heated crystals with one particular crystal refracting light, which blocks the way forward. A stalagmite also hangs above the ray of light.\n- Attempting to walk through the refracted light will burn you to death.\n- Using the jackhammer in the lower cavern causes all the crystals to break and flood the place with lava.\n- **Using my scout, I was able to find the stalagmite's location in the upper cave and knock it down with a jackhammer.**","x":-2460,"y":218,"width":539,"height":405,"color":"#870087"},
		{"id":"25888d730c396381","type":"text","text":"I heard an eerie language on the media disc. It sounded like \"Yanaush s'tyansh\" and had a oddly tuned frequency playing after it.","x":-3202,"y":1972,"width":403,"height":88,"color":"#990099"},
		{"id":"3596eca947afefbb","type":"text","text":"[[Lava Pass]]\n- I found a cave with lava pools and a passage on the other side.\n- The gravity of the planet is too strong for me to jump past the lava pools. \n- **When the gravity from Divine Devourer got stronger, I was able to make it across the lava pools.**\n-  **I heard an eerie language on the media disc. It sounded like \"_\"** ","x":-3270,"y":1633,"width":539,"height":262,"color":"#870087"},
		{"id":"e7a8b534c8a7eb35","type":"text","text":"[[Mineral Maze]]\n- **I found a maze within the caves of Manic Mesa that's littered in crystals.**\n- **After using the route in the recording, I reached the end of the maze.**","x":-2259,"y":2080,"width":334,"height":240,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"d5fbb40313985fae","type":"text","text":"[[Configuration Room]]\n- **I found some sort of control room overlooking the White Hole at the end of the maze. The controls don't seem to be powered.**\n- **After lighting up the power grid, the power in the Configuration Room came on.**\n- **Putting in the code from the recording allowed the white hole to grow just enough to jumpstart the Particle Accelerator.**","x":-1889,"y":2251,"width":334,"height":349,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"a5f65ba7b942ad66","type":"text","text":"Putting in the code from the recording allowed the white hole to grow just enough to jumpstart the Particle Accelerator.","x":-2073,"y":2690,"width":373,"height":108,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"c85c4c949f6739f4","type":"text","text":"I turned off the Plasma Blast Furnace and the power went out. It also feels a lot colder now.","x":-3720,"y":2066,"width":320,"height":110,"color":"#990099"},
		{"id":"de20d3635086d56f","type":"text","text":"A display device inside Purple Partition's Anomaly Lab shows a structure in the mantle of Purple Partition.\n","x":-838,"y":2481,"width":356,"height":91,"color":"#990099"},
		{"id":"e40afe8a65ec43a5","type":"text","text":"The Display Device inside the Music Hall shows that playing a song into the piano will unlock the door of the Particle Accelerator","x":-2707,"y":2761,"width":422,"height":99,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"521fc00fcfe8bf2c","type":"text","text":"I heard an eerie language on the media disc. It sounded like \"Yantsa S'Chayfrrrat Vashbinith, vin chin Chaylu ooo zhtheesau yantsin tsah ashaut.\"","x":-1401,"y":1923,"width":392,"height":92,"color":"#0400ff"},
		{"id":"298b87c88d5d66b8","type":"text","text":"[[Event Horizon]]\n- Hornfels once told me that the event horizon of a supermassive black hole like this one behaves differently than the primordial black holes seen throughout our home system due to their significantly higher mass.\n - Attempting to enter the event horizon instantly kills me.\n- \n- A display device in the Warped Planetarium shows that the event horizon is safe to cross at roughly the same angle as the eccentricity of the planets' orbits.\n- A display device in the Conductive Energy Plant shows that the event horizon is safe to cross if you approach it at the same speed as entering the lower atmosphere in Blowing Behemoth.\n- A display device in the Particle Accelerator shows that the event horizon is safe to cross when Divine Devourer consumes the entire system.\n- **I used the three rules to safely pass the Event Horizon!**","x":-539,"y":1470,"width":700,"height":410,"color":"#000000"},
		{"id":"402efc6382b6da84","type":"text","text":"[[Warped Observatory]] (Sealed Observatory)\n- I found an observatory on the surface of Purple Partition. There doesn't seem to be a way inside.\n- A display device inside Purple Partition's Anomaly Lab shows a path to the Observatory in the mantle of Purple Partition.\n- **After the planet snapped in half and making a treacherous flight to the other side, I made it to the Warped Observatory.**\n- **This telescope is so powerful, I can see Chert from here.**\n- **A display device in the Warped Observatory shows that the event horizon is safe to cross at roughly the same angle as the inclination of the planets' orbits.**","x":-912,"y":2640,"width":505,"height":360,"color":"#990099"},
		{"id":"973c045febe65715","type":"text","text":"A display device inside Manic Mesa's Anomaly Lab shows a structure near its core around a white hole.","x":-1886,"y":3170,"width":250,"height":140,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"dfd190ee347ae9e5","type":"text","text":"[[Manic Mesa Anomaly Lab]]\n- **I found a mysterious lab on Manic Mesa. It has some odd devices with sand inside them, as well as a Media Player and a White Hole.**\n- **A display device inside Manic Mesa's Anomaly Lab shows a structure near its core around a white hole.**          \n- **A display device in the Manic Mesa Anomaly Lab hints at a structure inside Divine Devourer.** ","x":-1479,"y":2870,"width":432,"height":300,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"2b484fe23406f770","type":"text","text":"A display device in the Warped Observatory shows that the event horizon is safe to cross at roughly the same angle as the inclination of the planets' orbits.","x":28,"y":2071,"width":429,"height":119,"color":"#870087"},
		{"id":"83d441eb2e946a3a","type":"text","text":"[[Purple Partition Anomaly Lab]]\n- **I found a mysterious lab on Purple Partition. It has some odd devices with sand inside them, as well as a Media Player and a White Hole.**\n- **A display device inside Purple Partition's Anomaly Lab shows a structure in the mantle of Purple Partition.**\n- **A display device in the Purple Partition Anomaly Lab hints at a structure inside Divine Devourer.**","x":-539,"y":2136,"width":505,"height":260,"color":"#990099"},
		{"id":"a695f8c9a8549631","type":"text","text":"A display device in the Purple Partition Anomaly Lab hints at a structure inside Divine Devourer.","x":-386,"y":2000,"width":395,"height":73,"color":"#000000"},
		{"id":"b0a2be9177851a55","type":"text","text":"A display device in the Particle Accelerator shows that the event horizon is safe to cross when Divine Devourer consumes the entire system.","x":-985,"y":2000,"width":402,"height":108,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"177e23efb4365159","type":"text","text":"A display device in the Manic Mesa Anomaly Lab hints at a structure inside Divine Devourer.","x":-660,"y":1904,"width":395,"height":73,"color":"#000000"},
		{"id":"af393cc02f41d9ef","type":"text","text":"[[Torrid Caverns]]\n- The caverns are too hot to enter!\n- **After turning off the Plasma Blast Furnace, I could safely enter the Torrid Caverns.**","x":-2440,"y":3440,"width":403,"height":166,"color":"#990099"},
		{"id":"ba078233b46bb95c","type":"text","text":"[[Particle Accelerator]]\n- A display device inside Manic Mesa's Anomaly Lab shows a structure near its core around a white hole.\n- I found the structure orbiting the white hole.\n- I can't reach it due to the White Hole's repel effect.\n- Configuring the interface in the Configuration Room a certain way allows the Particle Accelerator to absorb the white hole's energy completely.\n- The Display Device inside the Music Hall shows that playing a song into the piano will unlock the door of the Particle Accelerator\n- I made it inside the Particle Accelerator, but the electricity inside is still lacking power.\n- After Manic Mesa plunged into its star, the power turned on and I somehow survived.\n- A display device in the Particle Accelerator shows that the event horizon is safe to cross when Divine Devourer consumes the entire system.","x":-2420,"y":2900,"width":470,"height":500,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"92219764b1528bd6","type":"text","text":"[[Charcoal Chasm]]\n- **I found a dark cave at the bottom of the mountain. I can't see what's going on inside.**\n- **Following the sound to its source and using the jetpack starts to light up the region.**\n- **Turning on all of the sources with my jetpack lit the whole room up, with power appearing to be flowing in the room directly below.**","x":-3225,"y":2289,"width":449,"height":273,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"d39b10c4416fc6b4","type":"text","text":"[[Music Hall]] (Orchestral Anomaly)\n- I hear music coming from a cave inside Manic Mesa.\n- The music seems to be coming from inside a building. The building has a locked door and some sort of music-based code interface\n- **I played the song found on the recording on the interface and it opened the door.**\n- **Inside the building was a music hall with a piano at the stage and a white hole hanging above as lighting. The piano appears to be connected to something, and the white hole is where the mysterious song is coming from.**\n- **The Display Device inside the Music Hall shows that playing a song into the piano will unlock the door of the [[Particle Accelerator]].**\n- **The white hole lamp taught me a new frequency.**\n- **I found a recorder playing a new melody using the Symphonic Sounds frequency.**\n- **Playing the new melody activated something.**","x":-2712,"y":2130,"width":432,"height":560,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"8912a221db9c998f","type":"text","text":"[[Glacial Caverns]]\nThere's a cavern you can find by digging in a certain spot in Frigid Fog, not near the hurricane. Unlike other dark areas of the game, the caverns can be lit up by light. However, it's too cold down there for your Scout to function and your flashlight is not bright enough. The caverns cannot be lit until you grab a glowing crystal from Purple Partition.","x":-3615,"y":838,"width":485,"height":211,"color":"#ffffff"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"dc01198d2959418b","fromNode":"e9363a723413cc2c","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"4dfcb8d9e86fb764","toSide":"top"},
		{"id":"5e23692b8df85f5c","fromNode":"a214632c3deadd73","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"2b28fdf8a75a4fdd","toSide":"top"},
